         where='`src/main.ts:979-981` (the "can\'t save your village" banner waits for the end of the tutorial unless storage failed for a returning player).',
         what='In a private window or a browser with no IndexedDB, a newcomer plays the whole tutorial with no warning; a reload during it returns to step 1 with everything gone.',
